{"ratings":[{"id":"C1","consequence":"wrong","trigger":"plausible","reason":"After automatic merging, status can repeatedly direct an agent to review work that is already merged."},{"id":"C2","consequence":"wrong","trigger":"plausible","reason":"An external push can stale an acknowledged approval without the digest identifying the PR as needing review."},{"id":"C3","consequence":"nuisance","trigger":"plausible","reason":"The digest can prompt a premature review while requested changes are being prepared."},{"id":"C4","consequence":"wrong","trigger":"plausible","reason":"A private-strings file read failure silently removes the state and guidance an agent requested."},{"id":"C5","consequence":"wrong","trigger":"plausible","reason":"A historical landing block can direct an agent to retry a closed or resolved PR, wasting work on an action that will be refused."},{"id":"C6","consequence":"nuisance","trigger":"plausible","reason":"An approved PR can briefly appear to need review until its first PR snapshot is saved."},{"id":"C7","consequence":"wrong","trigger":"plausible","reason":"A very long saved question can consume substantial session context and waste agent work."},{"id":"C10","consequence":"test","trigger":"normal","reason":"The required validation command fails formatting on a test assertion before it reaches typechecking and tests."},{"id":"C11","consequence":"wrong","trigger":"plausible","reason":"An approval submitted during active repair can cause status to recommend landing while the repair is still running."},{"id":"C12","consequence":"wrong","trigger":"normal","reason":"Following the Codex skill reads Claude's feed cursor and can hide attention items still unread by Codex."},{"id":"C13","consequence":"nuisance","trigger":"normal","reason":"Each run-detail read performs an extra small query, with no demonstrated inconsistency or material performance impact."},{"id":"C14","consequence":"wrong","trigger":"normal","reason":"MCP approvals are recorded as human approvals, misleading decisions based on review provenance."}]}